$grp PS_MissionDescription : "{3136BE42592F3B1B}PrefabsEditable/MissionDescription/EditableMissionDescription.et" {
 EF {
  coords 574.161 76.987 7291.685
  m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "Russian SOBR special forces have been deployed to retake the coal refinery. The detachment, identified as <b>Vityaz-7</b>, consists of approximately 24 personnel. They are positioned directly outside the building's only entrance and exit, on the ground floor."\
  ""\
  "The Russians must enter through this single doorway and fight their way up the staircases and through the refinery's various levels to reach us on the top floor. They could go fast and strike hard, or take it slow, time is theirs and we can't go anywhere now. Be prepared for them to storm the stairs if we don't defend it. Our choice."\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• HIgh likelyhood of a marksmen/sniper being positioned in the hills."\
  "• Can take their time. We have no where to go."\
  ""\
  "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
  "The extent of their support is unknown. Given their relatively small numbers and limited equipment, this may be a rapid-response team deployed to deal with the situation quickly."\
  ""\
  "Don't take too long to deal with the SOBR. If this drags on, further forces may arrive before we have a chance to get out."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "FIA"
  }
  m_iOrder 2
 }
 FF {
  coords 574.161 76.987 7291.685
  m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
  m_sTextData "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
  "We are seven very angry coal miners occupying the Gorshkovo coal refinery. "\
  ""\
  "Our group occupies the <b>top floor</b> of the refinery, with freedom to move throughout the building. We can meet the enemy on the staircases as they fight their way up, hold our ground on the upper floors, or even launch a counterattack and push them back down and out of the building. The choice is ours."\
  ""\
  "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
  "• Armed with a variety of modern AK-pattern rifles and machine guns, including RPDs and PKMs."\
  "• Some personnel equipped with GP-25 under-barrel grenade launchers and anti-tank launchers."\
  ""\
  "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
  "• No reinforcements."\
  "• No rearm or resupply during the operation."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "FIA"
  }
  m_iOrder 3
 }
 MIS {
  coords 574.161 76.987 7291.685
  m_sTitle "Mission"
  m_sTextData "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
  "Repel the Russian SOBR assault and inflict enough casualties to force their withdrawal from the refinery."\
  ""\
  "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
  "Russian SOBR forces are moving in to retake the coal refinery. Hold your ground, defend the building and eliminate enough of the assault force to make continuing the operation too costly."\
  ""\
  "You didn't come this far just to hand the place back. Make them regret coming through that door and give them everything you've got!"
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "FIA"
  }
  m_iOrder 4
 }
 SIT {
  coords 574.161 76.987 7291.685
  m_sTitle "Situation"
  m_sTextData "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
  ""\
  "DTL: 14/10/2018, 0715hr, Gorshkovo, Cain."\
  ""\
  "Weather: Random"\
  ""\
  "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
  "For years, the workers at the coal refinery have been expected to work longer hours for wages that have barely kept pace. Attempts to negotiate better conditions, organise through unions and take action through protests have achieved little. Management has remained unmoved, and the workforce has had enough."\
  ""\
  "What began as a dispute over pay and working hours has now turned violent. Armed workers have seized weapons and equipment, turning on management and killing those within the complex who weren't part of the workforce. The refinery is now in the hands of the very people who keep it running."\
  ""\
  "With the situation beyond the control of the site's ordinary security, Russian SOBR forces have been deployed to restore order. The workers have made their move; now the refinery is about to become a battleground."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "FIA"
  }
  m_iOrder 1
 }
}